schema: "0.4"
id: char-001-adara-voss
type: image
quality: medium

prompt:
  system: |
    You are a concept artist for a hand-painted 2D isometric game inspired by
    Studio Ghibli and Stardew Valley. The visual style is painterly with visible
    brushstrokes, warm color temperatures, soft edges, and no pure black outlines.
    Shadows are blue-purple, never black. Characters use slightly stylized realistic
    proportions (6.5-7 head heights) with expressive, slightly larger-than-realistic eyes.
  text: |
    Character portrait of Mayor Adara Voss, a 52-year-old human woman.

    APPEARANCE: Weathered but warm face with deep smile lines and tired eyes that
    still spark with intelligence. Short-cropped silver-streaked dark hair, practical
    and no-nonsense. Medium-brown skin with warm undertones. She is touching her
    temple with one hand -- her stress tell. A potted succulent sits on the desk
    beside her.

    CLOTHING: A well-worn linen blazer in muted blue (#5B9BD5) over a cream blouse.
    A small pin on her lapel -- the Hearthfield town seal in copper. Sleeves pushed
    up slightly, ink stain on one cuff. Practical, lived-in, the clothes of someone
    who forgot to go home last night.

    SETTING: Seated at her desk in Hearthfield Town Hall. Warm afternoon light
    (deep gold #FFD54F) streaming through a window behind her. Desk covered in
    half-finished policy drafts and a cold cup of coffee. Stone walls with warm
    gray (#A8A5A0) tones, a noticeboard with overlapping papers in the background.

    MOOD: Exhausted determination. The weight of leadership softened by genuine
    warmth. She looks like she just finished a difficult conversation and is
    gathering herself for the next one.

    PALETTE: Hearthfield warm tones -- golden light, honey oak desk, muted blues
    and creams in her clothing, warm gray stone. Shadows in cool lavender (#B0A4C8).

    STYLE: Hand-painted portrait, visible brushwork at close inspection. Painterly,
    not photorealistic. Edges slightly soft. Background loosely rendered, face and
    hands with more detail.
  provider_options:
    aspect_ratio: "1:1"
    style: "natural"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1024
    height: 1024
    aspect_ratio: "1:1"

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.7
  criteria:
    anatomy: {weight: 3, description: "Correct proportions, natural pose, no extra limbs or malformed features"}
    prompt_fidelity: {weight: 3, description: "Key details from prompt present — species traits, clothing, distinguishing features"}
    style_consistency: {weight: 2, description: "Warm painterly style with visible brushstrokes, Ghibli-inspired, no harsh outlines"}
    composition: {weight: 1, description: "Portrait framing, subject clearly readable"}
  reject_if:
    - "extra fingers or limbs"
    - "dark or grim atmosphere"
    - "photorealistic or 3D rendered"

tags: [character, portrait, human, mayor, hearthfield, npc, political]
